            "description": "At least `title` and `file`; `file` carries `url` (schemeless, prefix with `https:`), `fileName`, `contentType`, and a vendor `details` object (`size`, plus `image: {width, height}` for image assets). `description` is present when the asset has one",
            "type": "object"
