            "description": "The labels applied, as ids: `INBOX`, `UNREAD`, `SENT`, `IMPORTANT`, `CATEGORY_PERSONAL`, plus any user label's opaque id. `UNREAD`'s presence is how read-state is expressed — there is no `read` boolean",
