                "requester": {
                  "description": "Write only. Alternative to requester_id for specifying the ticket requester.\n\nCan be provided as:\n- Email string: \"user@example.com\"\n- User ID integer: 12345\n- User object: {name: \"John Doe\", email: \"john@example.com\"}\n\nIf both requester and requester_id are provided, requester_id takes precedence.\n\nWhen creating a ticket, if the user doesn't exist, they may be created\nautomatically depending on account settings.\n",
