                      "positions": {
                        "description": "Character offsets in the input text field where this reference's citation marker should be inserted. Positions must be relative to the text field provided in the request (text, markdownText, or htmlText). When positions are present, only one text field may be provided. Positions must not exceed the length of the input text. The system recomputes positions relative to the final htmlText for internal processing.",
                        "example": [
                          42,
                          128
